"Param/Header Name is used to determine the name of the parameter to pass. For example, header authentication is typically passed through the 'Access-Token' header. If you are using the Request Body option and your API takes a parameter named 'token', you would enter 'token' as the name." = "Param/Header Name 用于确定要传递的参数名称。例如，header 身份验证通常通过 'Access-Token' header 传递。如果使用 Request Body 选项且 API 需要名为 'token' 的参数，请在名称栏输入 'token'。";
"The server may reject the request if the data is too large, which is usually a result of the image being high resolution. Pusher will try to forward the notification 5 times, shrinking the image each time by the factor you specify (if the body is too large). If by the last retry the image is too large, it will remove the image but set the \"image\" property to a 1 to indicate that an image is attached. The image will initially be resized to fit the maximum width and height unless it is already smaller. The image shrink factor must be greater than 1.0 to work since it is division (a factor of 2 means it will divide the image dimensions in half).\n\nThe following properties will be passed to the URL endpoint (via the selected HTTP method/body format) specified above (property names in parentheses) [Must Turn on \"Include Icon\" and \"Include Image\" switches above in order to get the corresponding properties below]:\n\nDevice Name (deviceName), App Name (appName), App Bundle ID (appID), Title (title), Subtitle (subtitle), Message (message), Date (date), Base64 Encoded PNG Icon 58x58 (icon), Base64 Encoded Image (image)" = "如果数据过大（通常是因为图片分辨率过高），服务器可能会拒绝请求。Pusher 会尝试转发通知 5 次，每次按你指定的系数缩小图片（如果 Request Body 仍然过大）。如果最后一次重试时图片仍过大，它会移除图片，但将 \"image\" 属性设为 1 以表示附有图片。图片最初会被缩放到最大宽度和高度以内（如果尚未小于该尺寸）。图片缩小系数必须大于 1.0 才能生效，因为它是除法运算（系数为 2 表示将图片尺寸减半）。\n\n以下属性会通过所选 HTTP 方法和请求体格式传递给上方指定的 URL Endpoint（括号内为属性名）[必须开启上方的“包含图标”和“包含图片”开关才能获得对应属性]：\n\n设备名称 (deviceName)、应用名称 (appName)、应用 Bundle ID (appID)、标题 (title)、副标题 (subtitle)、消息 (message)、日期 (date)、Base64 编码的 58x58 PNG 图标 (icon)、Base64 编码的图片 (image)";
"INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Click 'Open Date Format Instructions' above (https://nsdateformatter.com).\n2. Using the reference and examples, create your desired date format and enter it above. If you don't care about the date, you may leave it as the default\n\nExample formats for Saturday, April 13, 2019 @ 3:12 AM:\nEEEE, MMM d, yyyy = Saturday, Apr 13, 2019\nMM/dd/yyyy = 04/13/2019\nMM-dd-yyyy HH:mm = 04-13-2019 03:12\nMMM d, h:mm a = Apr 13, 3:12 AM\nE, d MMM yyyy HH:mm:ss Z = Sat, 13 Apr 2019 03:12:11 +0000\nyyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ssZ = 2019-04-13T03:12:11+0000\ndd.MM.yy = 13.04.19\nHH:mm:ss.SSS = 03:12:11.678\n" = "说明：\n1. 点击上方的“打开日期格式说明”(https://nsdateformatter.com)。\n2. 参考示例创建你想要的日期格式并输入上方。如果不关心日期，可以保留默认值。\n\n2019 年 4 月 13 日星期六 @ 上午 3:12 的示例格式：\nEEEE, MMM d, yyyy = Saturday, Apr 13, 2019\nMM/dd/yyyy = 04/13/2019\nMM-dd-yyyy HH:mm = 04-13-2019 03:12\nMMM d, h:mm a = Apr 13, 3:12 AM\nE, d MMM yyyy HH:mm:ss Z = Sat, 13 Apr 2019 03:12:11 +0000\nyyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ssZ = 2019-04-13T03:12:11+0000\ndd.MM.yy = 13.04.19\nHH:mm:ss.SSS = 03:12:11.678\n";
"SETUP:\n1. Click 'Open IFTTT Maker Webhooks Account' above (https://ifttt.com/services/maker_webhooks/settings).\n2. Click the 'Connect' button if it is not already connected.\n3. Copy the key at the end of the URL displayed (https://maker.ifttt.com/use/YOUR_KEY) into the associated field above.\n4. When you make an applet on IFTTT with the Maker Webhooks service, it will ask you for an event name. Enter that event name in the associated field above.\n\nWEBHOOK REQUEST DATA:\nIf Curate Request Data is enabled:\nThe \"Value1\" ingredient is set to the title (which includes app name), \"Value2\" is set to the message (which includes subtitle), and \"Value3\" is either the base64 encoded PNG 58x58 icon if \"Include Icon\" is turned on or the date string if \"Include Icon\" is turned off.\n\nIf Curate Request Data is disabled:\nThe following properties will be passed to the webhook trigger under the \"Value1\" ingredient (property names in parentheses) [Must Turn on \"Include Icon\" switch above in order to get the icon property]:\nDevice Name (deviceName), App Name (appName), App Bundle ID (appID), Title (title), Subtitle (subtitle), Message (message), Date (date), Base64 Encoded PNG Icon 58x58 (icon)" = "设置：\n1. 点击上方的“打开 IFTTT Maker Webhooks 账户”(https://ifttt.com/services/maker_webhooks/settings)。\n2. 如果尚未连接，请点击“Connect”按钮。\n3. 将显示的 URL（https://maker.ifttt.com/use/YOUR_KEY）末尾的 Key 复制到上方对应字段。\n4. 在 IFTTT 上使用 Maker Webhooks 服务创建 applet 时，它会要求你输入事件名称。请将事件名称输入到上方对应字段。\n\nWEBHOOK REQUEST DATA：\n如果启用了“整理请求数据”：\n\"Value1\" 会设置为标题（包含应用名称），\"Value2\" 会设置为消息（包含副标题），\"Value3\" 为 Base64 编码的 58x58 PNG 图标（如果开启“包含图标”）或日期字符串（如果关闭“包含图标”）。\n\n如果未启用“整理请求数据”：\n以下属性会作为 \"Value1\" 成分传递给 Webhook 触发器（括号内为属性名）[必须开启上方的“包含图标”开关才能获得图标属性]：\n设备名称 (deviceName)、应用名称 (appName)、应用 Bundle ID (appID)、标题 (title)、副标题 (subtitle)、消息 (message)、日期 (date)、Base64 编码的 58x58 PNG 图标 (icon)";
"SETUP:\n1. Click 'Open Pushbullet Account' above (https://www.pushbullet.com/#settings/account).\n2. Scroll down and click 'Create Access Token' on your account page.\n3. Copy the displayed access token into the associated field above.\n4. Click 'Receiving Devices' to validate your credentials and load the receiving device list." = "设置：\n1. 点击上方的“打开 Pushbullet 账户”(https://www.pushbullet.com/#settings/account)。\n2. 在账户页面向下滚动并点击“Create Access Token”。\n3. 将显示的 Access Token 复制到上方对应字段。\n4. 点击“接收设备”以验证凭据并加载接收设备列表。";
"SETUP:\n1. Click 'Create Pushover App' above (https://pushover.net/apps/build).\n2. Enter a name (e.g. 'Pusher'). Other fields are optional.\n3. Check the box (after reading their Terms of Service).\n4. Press 'Create Application' at the bottom.\n5. Copy the API Token/Key into the associated field above.\n6. Click 'Open Pushover Dashboard' above (https://pushover.net/dashboard).\n7. Copy 'Your User Key' into the associated field above.\n8. Click 'Receiving Devices' to validate your credentials and load the receiving device list." = "设置：\n1. 点击上方的“创建 Pushover 应用”(https://pushover.net/apps/build)。\n2. 输入名称（例如 'Pusher'）。其他字段可选。\n3. 阅读其服务条款后勾选相应复选框。\n4. 点击底部的“Create Application”。\n5. 将 API Token/Key 复制到上方对应字段。\n6. 点击上方的“打开 Pushover 控制台”(https://pushover.net/dashboard)。\n7. 将“Your User Key”复制到上方对应字段。\n8. 点击“接收设备”以验证凭据并加载接收设备列表。";
"The server may reject the request if the data is too large, which is usually a result of the image being high resolution. Pusher will try to forward the notification 5 times, shrinking the image each time by the factor you specify. If by the last retry the image is too large, it will remove the image but leave an indication that one is attached so the application may display a placeholder. The image will initially be resized to fit the maximum width and height unless it is already smaller. The image shrink factor must be greater than 1.0 to work since it is division (a factor of 2 means it will divide the image dimensions in half)." = "如果数据过大（通常是因为图片分辨率过高），服务器可能会拒绝请求。Pusher 会尝试转发通知 5 次，每次按你指定的系数缩小图片。如果最后一次重试时图片仍过大，它会移除图片但保留已附加图片的标记，以便应用显示占位图。图片最初会被缩放到最大宽度和高度以内（如果尚未小于该尺寸）。图片缩小系数必须大于 1.0 才能生效，因为它是除法运算（系数为 2 表示将图片尺寸减半）。";
"Use touser to specify message recipients.\nSeparate usernames with \"|\", like \"Tom|Jerry\". Default is \"@all\" for all users. Leave blank for \"@all\"." = "使用 touser 指定消息接收人。\n多个用户名用 \"|\" 分隔，例如 \"Tom|Jerry\"。默认为 \"@all\"（所有用户）。留空即为 \"@all\"。";
