"The script runs for each notification. Call push(req) to send one; call it more than once to send several, or not at all to skip this notification." = "脚本会针对每条通知运行。调用 push(req) 发送推送；调用多次可发送多条，完全不调用则跳过这条通知。";
"Sharing a context or a thread is faster but lets one notification's variables reach the next. A separate context is the safer default; a separate thread keeps a runaway script off the others." = "共享上下文或线程更快，但会让一条通知里的变量泄漏到下一条。独立上下文是更安全的默认值；独立线程可避免失控脚本影响其他运行。";

/* Custom service definitions */
"New Service" = "新建服务";
"Delete Service" = "删除服务";
"Defaults for New Services" = "新服务的默认选项";
"Services You Defined" = "你定义的服务";
"Service" = "服务";
"%d services use this. They will keep their settings but stop sending until they are given another type." = "%d 个服务正在使用它。它们的设置会保留，但在换绑其它类型之前不会再发送。";
"The script runs for every notification. Call push(req) to send one, call it more than once to send several, or not at all to skip this notification." = "脚本会针对每条通知运行。调用 push(req) 发送一条；调用多次可发送多条，不调用则跳过这条通知。";
"Services you add from this type start with these, and can still change them individually." = "从该类型添加的服务会以这些为初始值，之后仍可单独修改。";
"Each one becomes a service type you can add on the Services page." = "每一个都会成为可在“服务”页添加的服务类型。";
"Define a service by writing a script, then add it on the Services page." = "写一个脚本来定义服务，然后在“服务”页添加它。";
"After using the app filter, swipe to delete to unset it and show all apps again. Tap on any truncated log to expand it, and touch and hold a log to copy it to the clipboard.\n\nTap anywhere to continue." = "使用应用筛选后，左滑删除即可取消并重新显示所有应用。点按被截断的日志可展开；长按日志可复制到剪贴板。\n\n点按任意位置继续。";
"Run" = "运行";
"No output. The script ran and sent nothing — that is how it skips a notification." = "没有输出。脚本运行了但没有发送——跳过通知就是这样做的。";
"How to write a script" = "如何编写脚本";
"Scripting Guide" = "脚本编写指南";
"How a script works" = "脚本如何工作";
"The script runs once per notification. Call push(req) to send a request — call it more than once to send several, or not at all to skip this notification. Top-level await works, so you can fetch a token before sending." = "脚本每条通知运行一次。调用 push(req) 发送请求——调用多次可发送多条，不调用则跳过这条通知。支持顶层 await，可以先 fetch token 再发送。";
"bullet — the notification" = "bullet——通知内容";
"bullet.deviceName, bullet.appName, bullet.appID, bullet.title, bullet.subtitle, bullet.message, bullet.date are strings. bullet.icon and bullet.image are base64 PNG data (strings), present when the notification has them." = "bullet.deviceName、bullet.appName、bullet.appID、bullet.title、bullet.subtitle、bullet.message、bullet.date 均为字符串。bullet.icon 和 bullet.image 是 base64 PNG 数据（字符串），通知带有图标/图片时才存在。";
"Other functions" = "其它可用函数";
"fetch(url, init) — real HTTP, like the browser's fetch. Returns a Response with ok, status, and json()/text().\nlocalStorage — persists values between notifications, per service.\nconsole.log(...) — shown in the editor's Run output." = "fetch(url, init)——真实 HTTP，与浏览器 fetch 相同。返回 Response，含 ok、status 和 json()/text()。\nlocalStorage——按服务持久化，跨通知保留。\nconsole.log(...)——显示在编辑器的运行输出中。";
"Limits" = "限制";
"The script must finish within 2 seconds, so no long loops. Fetch runs for real: during a run, requests are actually sent." = "脚本须在 2 秒内完成，不要写长循环。fetch 是真实请求：运行时会真正发出。";
"Let an AI write it" = "让 AI 来写";
"Tap the copy button (top right) to copy a prompt that describes this API. Paste it into your AI assistant and add the result you want — which service to send to, what to filter, and so on — then paste the JavaScript it writes back here." = "点右上角的复制按钮，复制描述了本 API 的提示词。粘贴到你的 AI 助手，并补充你想要的结果——发送到哪个服务、如何筛选等——然后把它生成的 JavaScript 粘贴回这里。";
"Copy AI Prompt" = "复制 AI 提示词";
"AI prompt copied. Paste it into your AI assistant and describe the result you want." = "AI 提示词已复制。粘贴到你的 AI 助手，并描述你想要的结果。";
"Close" = "关闭";
"This is a SYSTEM PROMPT. Everything before the marker below is fixed context you must follow; after the marker is what the user wants. Do not answer the system part — generate code only." = "这是一段系统提示词。下面分隔线之前的内容是固定背景，你必须遵守；分隔线之后是用户的需求。不要回应系统提示本身——只生成代码。";
"Write a JavaScript script for Pusher, an iOS tweak that forwards notifications to a push service." = "为 Pusher 编写一段 JavaScript 脚本。Pusher 是一个把 iOS 通知转发到推送服务的越狱插件。";
"Runtime: JavaScriptCore on iOS. The script runs once per notification, as an async function, so top-level await works. Modern syntax (const/let, arrow functions, destructuring, optional chaining, async/await, Promise) is available. There is no DOM, no Node APIs, no timers." = "运行时：iOS 上的 JavaScriptCore。脚本每条通知运行一次，以 async 函数形式执行，支持顶层 await。可用现代语法（const/let、箭头函数、解构、可选链、async/await、Promise）。没有 DOM、没有 Node API、没有定时器。";
"Injected values:" = "注入的变量：";
"- bullet — the notification:\n    bullet.deviceName  string  this iPhone's name\n    bullet.appName     string  the sending app's display name\n    bullet.appID       string  the sending app's bundle ID\n    bullet.title       string  may be empty\n    bullet.subtitle    string  may be empty\n    bullet.message     string  the notification body\n    bullet.date        string  formatted timestamp\n    bullet.icon        string  base64 PNG of the app icon\n    bullet.image       string  base64 of the attachment image" = "- bullet——通知内容：\n    bullet.deviceName  字符串  本机名称\n    bullet.appName     字符串  发送通知的应用显示名\n    bullet.appID       字符串  发送通知的应用 bundle ID\n    bullet.title       字符串  可能为空\n    bullet.subtitle    字符串  可能为空\n    bullet.message     字符串  通知正文\n    bullet.date        字符串  已格式化的时间戳\n    bullet.icon        字符串  应用图标的 base64 PNG\n    bullet.image       字符串  通知附件图片的 base64";
"Injected functions:" = "注入的函数：";
"default \"POST\"" = "默认 \"POST\"";
"an object is sent as JSON" = "对象会以 JSON 发送";
"an object is sent as JSON" = "对象会以 JSON 发送";
"Rules:" = "规则：";
"- Call push() to forward the notification; without it, nothing is sent.\n- The script must finish within 2 seconds.\n- Do not use while(true) loops or blocking patterns." = "- 调用 push() 才会转发通知；不调用则什么都不会发送。\n- 脚本必须在 2 秒内完成。\n- 不要使用 while(true) 死循环或阻塞式写法。";
"Output ONLY the JavaScript source — no markdown fences, no explanation, no commentary." = "只输出 JavaScript 源码——不要 markdown 代码围栏、不要解释、不要任何说明文字。";
"USER REQUIREMENT — replace the line below with what you want, or write your requirement after this prompt:" = "用户需求——把下面这一行替换成你想要的效果，或直接在本提示词后面写下你的需求：";
"★ Write here what you want the script to do." = "★ 在这里写下你想让脚本实现的效果。";
"The prompt tells the AI the API. Add what you want the script to do below — the AI only writes code, it does not invent your requirement." = "提示词教给 AI 的是本插件的 API。在下面补充你想让脚本做什么——AI 只负责写代码，不会替你发明需求。";
"What should the script do?" = "你想让脚本做什么？";
"Copy" = "复制";
"Copied. Paste it into your AI assistant." = "已复制。粘贴到你的 AI 助手即可。";
"Tap Copy AI Prompt (top right). The prompt is a system prompt — it teaches the AI this API. The copy dialog asks what you want the script to do; write it there, then paste the whole thing to your AI assistant and paste the JavaScript it writes back here." = "点右上角的「复制 AI 提示词」。提示词是系统提示词——教给 AI 本插件的 API。复制对话框会问你想让脚本做什么；在那里填上，然后把整段内容粘贴给你的 AI 助手，再把它生成的 JavaScript 粘贴回这里。";
"Max Response Size (MB)" = "最大响应大小（MB）";
"A shared context must stay on its own thread (JSContext thread affinity), so every run uses its own thread." = "共享的上下文必须固定在创建它的线程上（JSContext 的线程亲和性），因此每次运行都会使用独立线程。";
"A shared context must stay on the thread it was created on (JSContext thread affinity), so every run shares the thread too." = "共享的上下文必须固定在创建它的线程上（JSContext 的线程亲和性），因此每次运行也必然共享线程。";
"Advanced Settings" = "高级设置";
"Every run reuses one JavaScript context — faster, and a script can carry state between notifications. Off, each run gets a fresh context, so one run's variables can never leak into another." = "每次运行复用同一个 JavaScript 上下文——更快，且脚本可以在通知之间携带状态。关闭后每次运行都会获得全新上下文，上一条推送的变量绝不会泄漏到下一条。";
"Runs queue on one thread. A shared context requires this (JSContext thread affinity); with own contexts it only orders the runs." = "所有运行在同一条线程上排队。共享上下文时必须如此（JSContext 的线程亲和性）；使用独立上下文时它只负责让运行按顺序执行。";
"A shared context must stay on the thread it was created on (JSContext thread affinity), so sharing the thread is required and locked on." = "共享的上下文必须固定在创建它的线程上（JSContext 的线程亲和性），因此共享线程是必需的，已强制开启并锁定。";
"How a run of this type executes." = "该类型的运行方式。";
"These seed new services of this type, like the options above." = "和上面的选项一样，这些会成为该类型新服务的初始值。";
"Get a token first" = "先获取令牌";
"Remember values between runs" = "在多次运行之间记住数值";
"What the notification carries" = "通知都携带哪些内容";
"Calling nothing skips the notification instead of forwarding it." = "不调用 push 表示跳过这条通知，而不是转发它。";
"Top-level await works: the script is run as an async function." = "支持顶层 await：脚本以 async 函数的形式运行。";
"localStorage is kept per service, so two services of this type do not share it." = "localStorage 按服务隔离，因此同一类型的两个服务不会共享它。";
"bullet.deviceName, bullet.appName, bullet.appID, bullet.title, bullet.subtitle, bullet.message, bullet.date" = "bullet.deviceName、bullet.appName、bullet.appID、bullet.title、bullet.subtitle、bullet.message、bullet.date";
"bullet.icon   — base64 PNG of the app icon\nbullet.image  — base64 of the notification's attachment" = "bullet.icon   — 应用图标的 base64 PNG\nbullet.image  — 通知附件图片的 base64";
"Also available: fetch(url, init), localStorage, console.log()" = "其它可用：fetch(url, init)、localStorage、console.log()";
"The token is cached in localStorage, so a page of notifications does not fetch a new one for every message. It is re-fetched once it is older than the expiry the server returned." = "令牌会缓存在 localStorage 中，因此一批通知不会为每条消息都去获取新令牌。当它超过服务器返回的有效期后才会重新获取。";
"The server's own lifetime when it gives one; an hour when it does not, since a cache that never expires is worse than one that expires too early." = "服务器给了有效期就用它的；没给则按一小时算——永不过期的缓存比过早过期的更糟。";
"A minute early, so a token cannot expire mid-flight." = "提前一分钟过期，避免令牌在飞行途中失效。";
"bullet.icon   — base64 PNG of the app icon" = "bullet.icon   — 应用图标的 base64 PNG";
"bullet.image  — base64 of the notification's attachment" = "bullet.image  — 通知附件图片的 base64";
"Where variables live" = "变量存在哪里";
"The script runs fresh for every notification. A top-level let or const belongs to that run alone and is gone by the next one — that is what keeps one notification's data out of another's.\nlocalStorage is the way to carry a value across notifications: it is kept per service, so two services of the same type do not share it." = "每条通知都会重新运行脚本。顶层声明的 let 或 const 只属于这一次运行，下一条通知时就已消失——这正是让通知之间数据互不串扰的原因。\n要跨通知保留数值请使用 localStorage：它按服务隔离，因此同一类型的两个服务不会共享它。";
"JavaScript Hooks" = "JavaScript 钩子";
"Runs for every notification this service would receive. A hook cannot send anything: it decides whether to continue (keep) and may rewrite the notification's text." = "该服务本会收到的每条通知都会运行。钩子无法发送任何内容：它决定是否继续（keep），并可以改写通知文本。";
"On Receiving" = "收到通知时";
"After Filtering" = "筛选之后";
"Edit Received Hook" = "编辑「收到通知时」钩子";
"Edit Filtered Hook" = "编辑「筛选之后」钩子";
"Guide" = "指南";
"What a hook does" = "钩子做什么";
"Deciding" = "如何决定";
"device — the device" = "device — 设备状态";
"If a hook fails" = "钩子出错时";
"Functions" = "可用函数";
"Runs as soon as the notification arrives for this service — before the app list, the notification settings and the device conditions are consulted." = "该服务收到通知时立即运行——早于应用黑白名单、通知设置条件和设备状态的判断。";
"Runs after every filter has already passed, immediately before the request is built — the last place to change what goes out." = "在所有筛选都已通过之后、构建请求之前立即运行——改变发出内容的最后机会。";
"Reports the device; it does not set it. Assigning to it changes nothing, which is deliberate: a hook must not be able to tell the filters that the device is in a state it is not." = "只报告设备状态，不设置它。赋值不会生效，这是刻意的：钩子不能让筛选器以为设备处于它并不处于的状态。";
"These three fields are yours to rewrite: what you leave in bullet when you call keep() is what the rest of the pipeline sees, including the log and the payload." = "这三个字段由你改写：调用 keep() 时 bullet 里的值就是后续管线看到的内容，包括日志与推送载荷。";
"A hook that throws before deciding does not drop the notification: it continues, and the reason appears in the log. A hook that fails while switched off costs nothing at all." = "在做出决定前抛错的钩子不会丢弃通知：通知会继续，原因记入日志。关闭状态下的钩子完全不产生开销。";
"The hook runs fresh for every notification, so a top-level let or const is gone by the next one. localStorage is how a value survives — kept per service and per hook, so this hook and the other one on the same service do not share it." = "每条通知都会重新运行钩子，因此顶层 let 或 const 下一条通知时就已消失。要保留数值请用 localStorage——它按服务和钩子分别隔离，因此同一个服务的两个钩子不会共享它。";
"The hook must finish within 2 seconds. Fetch runs for real, so a hook that asks a model to read a message does make that request — on every notification it runs for." = "钩子必须在 2 秒内完成。fetch 会真实发出请求，因此用模型识别短信的钩子，每运行一次就真的会调用一次。";
"A hook cannot send anything: there is no push(). It decides whether to continue and may rewrite the notification's text." = "钩子无法发送任何内容：没有 push()。它决定是否继续，并可以改写通知文本。";
"This prompt describes this API. Add what you want below — the AI writes the code, it does not decide what you need." = "这段提示词描述了本 API。请在下方补充你想要的效果——AI 只负责写代码，不会替你决定需要什么。";
"What should it do?" = "你希望它做什么？";
"Read the notification's fields and decide. bullet.icon and bullet.image are present only when the notification carries them." = "读取通知字段并作出判断。bullet.icon 与 bullet.image 仅在通知确实携带时才存在。";
"Call push() to forward the notification; without it nothing is sent." = "调用 push() 才会转发通知；不调用则什么都不发。";
"Call keep() to let the notification through; returning without it drops it." = "调用 keep() 才会放行通知；不调用则丢弃它。";
"Rewriting bullet.title/subtitle/message changes what is sent." = "改写 bullet.title/subtitle/message 会改变发出的内容。";
"device is read-only: it reports the device, it does not set it." = "device 是只读的：它报告设备状态，不设置它。";
"The script must finish within 2 seconds." = "脚本必须在 2 秒内完成。";
"The hook must finish within 2 seconds." = "钩子必须在 2 秒内完成。";
"Do not use while(true) loops or blocking patterns." = "不要使用 while(true) 循环或阻塞式写法。";
"Each notification is a separate run: a variable declared at the top level does not survive to the next one. Use localStorage for that." = "每条通知都是一次独立运行：顶层声明的变量不会保留到下一条。需要保留请用 localStorage。";
