"Tap Copy AI Prompt (top right). It is a system prompt: it teaches the assistant this API. The dialog asks what you want the script to do — write it there, paste the whole thing to your assistant, then paste the JavaScript it writes back here." = "点右上角「复制 AI 提示词」。这是一段系统提示词，教会助手本 API。对话框会询问你希望脚本做什么——写在那里，把整段粘贴给助手，再把它生成的 JavaScript 粘回这里。";
"Tap Copy AI Prompt (top right). It is a system prompt that teaches the assistant this hook's API. The dialog asks what you want; paste the whole thing to your assistant, then paste the JavaScript it writes back here." = "点右上角「复制 AI 提示词」。这是一段系统提示词，教会助手本钩子的 API。对话框会询问你的需求；把整段粘贴给助手，再把它生成的 JavaScript 粘回这里。";
"The script runs fresh for every notification. A top-level let or const belongs to that run alone and is gone by the next one — that is what keeps one notification's data out of another's.\nlocalStorage is how a value survives to the next notification: it is kept per service, so two services of the same type do not share it." = "每条通知都会重新运行脚本。顶层 let 或 const 只属于那一次运行，下一条通知时就已消失——这正是让通知之间数据互不串扰的原因。\nlocalStorage 是让数值保留到下一条通知的方式：它按服务隔离，因此同一类型的两个服务不共享它。";
